REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_DACB DacB PBP4 DD-carboxypeptidase/endopeptidase after DacA
# Continuum ...->nagb->pfka->mura->murb->murc->murd->mure->murf->mray->murg->murj->mtga->uppp->ldtd->mltg->ldta->ldtb->ldtc->ldte->ldtf->daca->dacb
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow.

ENTITY gate OF Cell 1 40 0
ENTITY poor OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 20 0
ENTITY twin OF Cell 1 30 0
ENTITY ceil OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY g0 OF Cell 1 24 0
ENTITY starved OF Cell 1 36 0
ENTITY printer OF Cell 1 48 0

